  "coupled": {
    "Barrel": "min(Slide, 0.01): the barrel rides the slide's first centimetre, locked to its breech face (short recoil), then stops; the slide brings it home",
    "Hammer": "at least as far back as the slide cams it: the recoiling slide pushes it back and it rides home on the slide's rear face (baked into every action)"
  },
