  "hand_sockets": {
    "convention": "origin = the wrist pivot (the head of the character's Hand bone); the socket's glTF / Godot basis IS the Hand bone's basis for that grip (Tensor: X along the knuckle line, the left thumb on -X and the right on +X, Y from the wrist to the knuckles, Z out of the palm). In Godot set the hand bone's global pose to the socket's transform (relative to the skeleton) and solve the arm to reach it; or carry the gun in the right hand with gun = hand_bone_global * RightHandSocket_local.inverse(). In Blender the empties' own axes are (X, -Z, Y) of the bone frame because the exporter converts empties, not bones.",
    "grip_pose": "grip_pose_deg per socket: Tensor's finger and thumb bone rotations (local XYZ, degrees) that close each hand onto its grip (animations/retarget.py closes Tensor's hands to them); the right index finger curls in to the trigger",
