      -0.0,
      -0.0523,
      0.045
    ],
    "rotation_wxyz_blender": [
      1.0,
      0.0,
      0.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "position_godot": [
      -0.0,
      0.045,
      0.0523
    ],
    "note": "the ammo pack is its own model (<name>_ammo.glb / .fbx / .blend, its origin at its bottom centre, square to its own axes, its real size): parent its mesh to the AmmoMount node unmoved and it rides the Mag bone where the weapon's actions put it (a reload's release and insert); the weapon's own files carry no pack mesh. The same model is the ammo pickup."
  },
